# OpenAI / ChatGPT Surge external ruleset
# Policy is assigned by the importing RULE-SET line.
#
# Legacy baseline verification (retrieved 2026-10-09):
# - This list preserves all 35 active rules from the current Surge profile's
#   third-party OpenAI ruleset:
#   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/master/rule/Surge/OpenAI/OpenAI.list
# - That source identifies itself as Blackmatrix7's OpenAI list, last updated
#   2025-06-06. Some entries are supporting services (for example, Arkose,
#   LiveKit, Azure, Datadog, Stripe, and Sentry), rather than OpenAI-owned
#   domains; they remain here to preserve the old routing behavior.
#
# ChatGPT Sites verification (2026-10-09):
# - https://hello-web-demo-sep30.winx402.chatgpt.site returned the OpenAI /
#   ChatGPT sign-in page (HTTP 401), with a response cookie scoped to
#   .chatgpt.site. The added DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.site covers this site and
#   other sites hosted beneath this suffix.
#
# Official reference points:
# - https://help.openai.com/
# - https://platform.openai.com/docs/

